            "type": "example",
            "title": "Casgevy",
            "body": "In November 2023 the UK's MHRA approved Casgevy, the first licensed CRISPR-based therapy; the FDA followed in December for sickle cell disease and in January 2024 for beta thalassemia. It edits a patient's own blood stem cells to switch fetal hemoglobin back on. US list price: about $2.2 million.",
            "art": "seed"
