            "title": "Two True Headlines",
            "body": "Imagine a trial in which a drug cuts heart attacks from 4 in 100 patients to 3 in 100. Headline A: 'Drug cuts heart attacks by 25%.' Headline B: 'Drug prevents one heart attack per hundred patients treated.' Neither is false. They are the same result, and they feel nothing alike.",
