            "type": "concept",
            "title": "Habituation: The Only Question",
            "body": "Babies look longer at what is new. Show one image until looking time drops by half, then swap it: if she looks longer again, she registered a difference. Nearly everything known about infant minds rests on that one measure, plus its cousins, sucking rate and heart rate.",
