    "category": "Philosophy",
    "description": "Epicurus and Nagel on whether death can harm you, Bernard Williams on the tedium of endless life, Scheffler on why other people's futures may matter more than your own, and the distribution problem behind every longevity promise. Arguments, not slogans.",
