            "type": "concept",
            "title": "Elaboration: Ask Why",
            "body": "Instead of rereading a fact, ask why it has to be true and what it rules out. Why would a man without a hippocampus still improve at a motor skill? Answering hooks the fact into a network you already own, and every hook is another route back to it later.",
