            "body": "Voyager 1 has been flying since 1977 and is now roughly 170 times as far from the Sun as Earth is. That sounds enormous. It is about three thousandths of a light-year, and the nearest other star sits 4.24 light-years away. No sample of another star will ever reach a laboratory. Everything we claim to know arrives as light.",
